<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n85362" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολυ-στεφής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>decked with many wreaths,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Eu.</u>
				39
			</span></i>; <i>earning many crowns,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μόχθοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>APl.</u>
					5.338
				</span></i>
			: c. gen., <i>wreathed with,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δάφνης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>OT</u>
					83
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>twisted in many a wreath,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κότινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nic.
					<u>Th.</u>
					378
				</span></i>
			; of a serpent (expld. by Sch. as <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολλοὺς στεφάνους ἔχοντες καὶ γραμμάς</span>)<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, μύαγροι</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				490
			</span></i> (s.v.l.; fort. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-στρεφέας</span>).
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>containing many circles,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐρανός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Herm.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Stob.
				1
			</span></i>. 
			<i><span class="en">
				49.44
			</span></i>.</div>
